              <li>Compute excess X = T − Ts for every row.</li>
              <li>Plot ln X vs t; fit the best straight line.</li>
              <li>Slope = −k; quote k in min⁻¹ and half-life ln2/k.</li>
              <li>Cross-check with the equal-fraction ratio rule above.</li>
